This crate is an independent implementation written from the published Recommendation and
papers (for ViSQOL chiefly Chinen et al., QoMEX 2020). It is not affiliated with or endorsed
by ITU, OPTICOM, Google, or the authors of the 2f model, ViSQOL, or the Python reference
